OL,3,GNEWSARNLI crews get first glimpse at
OL,4,Anew lifeboat
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteer RNLI crews across the Channel
OL,7,FIslands have got their first glimpse of
OL,8,Fnew all-weather lifeboats.
OL,10,FAlderney, St Helier, and St Peter Port
OL,11,Fare due to each receive a new Shannon
OL,12,FM2k class lifeboat in the next 18
OL,13,Fmonths to replace existing all-weather
OL,14,Fvessels as part of the charity's
OL,15,Flifeboat fleet strategy.
OL,17,FFrom Wednesday until Friday, the RNLI
OL,18,Frelief lifeboat 13-26 John Metters is
OL,19,Fvisiting each of the islands to give
OL,20,Fcrews hands-on experience. The new
OL,21,Fmodel includes an upgraded navigation
OL,22,Fsystem and improved safety features.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
