OL,3,GNEWSARNLI crews get first glimpse at
OL,4,Anew lifeboat
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity said the Shannon class
OL,7,Fboats would "ensure crews are equipped
OL,8,Fto respond effectively to modern search
OL,9,Fand rescue demands".
